205-+
206:+The parent and independent `gpt-6-astra` cross-judge selected candidate 2, the typed attribution design. Candidates 1 and 2 each scored 23 out of 25 against the design rubric. Persisted attribution decisions broke the tie because the CLI must produce an inspectable answer for offline consumers.
